    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One evening, a young woman disappears after work. She wakes up in a cold basement cell.<br>A sinister voice from a speaker says: &quot;To escape, you must solve the puzzles.&quot; But this isn't rescue \u2014 it's a game. And no one has ever won.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cell bears traces of previous victims. Some loved butterflies, others hid behind music... Now it's your turn.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, solve, think, hide, run. But remember: the killer is watching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;To Last&quot; is a first-person atmospheric survival horror game with a strong narrative focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will experience intense atmosphere, puzzles, and an ever-present threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room tells its own story. Every object carries a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect clues, understand what the victims went through, and find your way out. But hurry \u2014 time is against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENEMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He can see you.<br>He hears your footsteps.<br>He feels your fear.\u200bBundesligaBab.la+6Wikipedia+6Bab.la+6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dark labyrinth crafted by a cannibal, every action has consequences.<br>Hiding isn't enough \u2014 you must be smart. To him, you're not a person... you're a meal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECTIBLE AND INTERACTIVE ITEMS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All items can be collected. Some will save your life, others reveal the past.<br>Documents, diaries, photos, bloody notes... Each step brings you closer to uncovering this nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REMEMBER</strong><br>This isn't just a puzzle game. This isn't just an escape room.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;To Last&quot; \u2014 can you endure until the end?\u200b</p>",
